PRIORITY 5 - UPLOAD MODULE (File uploads)
================================================================================

STATUS: ⚠️ Keep as REST (Recommended)

Current Frontend Usage:
  - hooks/utils/useUpload.ts - POST upload (multipart/form-data)

Why Keep REST:
  - GraphQL file uploads require additional libraries (apollo-upload-client)
  - REST multipart/form-data is simpler and more standard
  - Smaller files, less complexity
  - Already working well

Alternative (if GraphQL required):
  1. Install apollo-upload-server on backend
  2. Add Upload scalar type
  3. Create mutation uploadFiles(files: [Upload!]!): UploadResult!
  4. Install apollo-upload-client on frontend

Recommendation: ❌ DO NOT MIGRATE - Keep REST for file uploads

